    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A piano improvisation \u00d7 visual novel experience.</strong><br><strong>Join the stream and listen to Allegro Molto\u2019s music\u2014just like a real fan.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cListening to Allegro Molto\u201d</i> is a vertical-format visual novel<br>where you take on the role of a viewer tuning in to VTuber <i>Allegro Molto\u2019s</i> stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through gentle conversations, flowing comments, and live piano improvisation,<br>you\u2019ll enjoy the feeling of being <i>inside</i> a quiet, late-night broadcast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a game about challenges or choices\u2014<br>It\u2019s a space to relax, listen, and immerse yourself in the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfect for players who:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy calm, ambient piano improvisations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to experience a fictional VTuber stream from the inside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are fans of Allegro Molto or curious about her music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents &amp; Playtime</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 improvised piano tracks (~3 min each) + \u03b1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total playtime: ~30 minutes per playthrough</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just 2 simple controls \u2014 easy to enjoy!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click the screen</strong>: Advance the text manually</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AUTO Button</strong>: Enable auto-play mode (Perfect for relaxing and enjoying the music hands-free!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short and peaceful novel game where music takes center stage.</strong><br><strong>If you\u2019ve got a moment, come listen in.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A piano improvisation \u00d7 visual novel experience.</strong><br><strong>Join the stream and listen to Allegro Molto\u2019s music\u2014just like a real fan.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cListening to Allegro Molto\u201d</i> is a vertical-format visual novel<br>where you take on the role of a viewer tuning in to VTuber <i>Allegro Molto\u2019s</i> stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through gentle conversations, flowing comments, and live piano improvisation,<br>you\u2019ll enjoy the feeling of being <i>inside</i> a quiet, late-night broadcast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a game about challenges or choices\u2014<br>It\u2019s a space to relax, listen, and immerse yourself in the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfect for players who:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy calm, ambient piano improvisations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to experience a fictional VTuber stream from the inside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are fans of Allegro Molto or curious about her music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents &amp; Playtime</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 improvised piano tracks (~3 min each) + \u03b1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total playtime: ~30 minutes per playthrough</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just 2 simple controls \u2014 easy to enjoy!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click the screen</strong>: Advance the text manually</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AUTO Button</strong>: Enable auto-play mode (Perfect for relaxing and enjoying the music hands-free!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short and peaceful novel game where music takes center stage.</strong><br><strong>If you\u2019ve got a moment, come listen in.</strong></p>",
